type: dataset
title: "Strained Prismatic Geometry"
abstract: "Deformation over the Absolute Base and the abc Conjecture. A monograph in five volumes bound as one, a self-contained research subject of the Grothendieckian Programme: a global substrate over which Spec Z acquires a relative cotangent direction, bad reduction read as strain, an unconditional trace-invariance theorem, a master inequality and an abc inequality over Q proved conditionally on a named ledger of ninety-eight obligations, and the companion package abctk. The abc conjecture remains open; this work does not prove it."
